Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.01,0:01:53.01,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Hey Mom, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.01,0:01:54.56,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Hey, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.56,0:01:55.14,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Um.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.31,0:01:58.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.19,0:01:59.31,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Play with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.56,0:02:02.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What do you play with Sanae-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.19,0:02:04.48,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Read books.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.48,0:02:06.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Did you bring one?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.82,0:02:09.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,How about with the old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.99,0:02:11.12,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Baseball.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.57,0:02:12.57,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Baseball?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.57,0:02:14.28,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.91,0:02:19.92,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Komada.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.92,0:02:21.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Imitations?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.67,0:02:23.96,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Not funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:25.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.63,0:02:27.76,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.42,0:02:31.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What is that old man teaching?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.43,0:02:36.14,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Mom! Mom, listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.14,0:02:37.93,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Come on, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.93,0:02:39.31,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.31,0:02:40.94,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Mom! Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.94,0:02:43.11,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Be quiet. You're embarrassing yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.11,0:02:44.57,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,It's because you're not listening to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.57,0:02:45.44,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Keep it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.94,0:02:48.03,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Think about those around you a little!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.53,0:02:49.40,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.40,0:02:50.20,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.57,0:02:51.78,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,We're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.57,0:02:53.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.54,0:02:59.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.87,0:03:03.54,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\pos(960,410.000015)\3c&H4A8A5C&}Episode 18
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.87,0:03:03.54,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\3c&H4A8A5C&\pos(960,720)}The Ends of the Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.42,0:03:03.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.88,0:03:08.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,God...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.01,0:03:12.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey. If you're going to the bathroom, say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.93,0:03:14.85,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.18,0:03:19.27,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Were you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.77,0:03:23.23,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.27,0:03:25.77,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,She said no crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.27,0:03:27.27,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Who did?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.61,0:03:28.82,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Sanae-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.15,0:03:30.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She did?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.19,0:03:32.24,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She's unexpectedly strict.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.99,0:03:35.74,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,But she said there are places I can cry. {There are two places, but Ushio say only one. Leave it as plural.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.99,0:03:38.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.87,0:03:44.08,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.71,0:03:48.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess you can cry without anyone noticing in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.84,0:03:52.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I think you can cry when you want to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.68,0:03:55.84,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's better to cry now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.80,0:04:02.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,There are many times when you can't cry even when you want to after you grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.57,0:04:17.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.03,0:04:19.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do you want a toy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.12,0:04:20.12,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fnEdo SZ\fs90\pos(960,226.5)\c&H051B38&\b1}Souvenirs Local Products
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.12,0:04:21.41,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Choose something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.41,0:04:22.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll buy it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.33,0:04:22.96,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.46,0:04:32.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.17,0:04:34.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,How's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.18,0:04:37.09,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.81,0:04:43.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't force yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.23,0:04:48.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You would have preferred a girlier toy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.90,0:04:49.86,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.86,0:04:51.28,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I wanted this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.98,0:04:52.86,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.49,0:04:56.24,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You have a strange taste, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.11,0:04:58.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nothing. Keep playing with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.95,0:04:59.62,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.16,0:05:04.75,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's a fun summer vacation for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.58,0:05:08.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Of course not; not when she's with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.22,0:05:18.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.93,0:05:19.93,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.93,0:05:22.51,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Poop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.47,0:05:25.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's dark, so be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.39,0:05:26.02,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.07,0:05:34.19,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\c&H7CB4F4&\fnHandwritten Crystal v2\frz4.489\pos(1192.5,310.5)}Women's \N{\c&H6FA6A5&}restroom
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.19,0:05:34.32,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\c&H7CB4F4&\fnHandwritten Crystal v2\frz4.489\pos(1186.5,316.5)}Women's \N{\c&H6FA6A5&}restroom
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.32,0:05:34.44,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\c&H7CB4F4&\fnHandwritten Crystal v2\frz4.489\pos(1180.5,321)}Women's \N{\c&H6FA6A5&}restroom
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.44,0:05:38.57,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\frz2.673\c&H7CB4F4&\fnHandwritten Crystal v2\pos(1168.5,328.5)}Women's \N{\c&H6FA6A5&}restroom
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.82,0:05:37.15,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I did it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.78,0:05:43.24,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.24,0:05:44.37,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.12,0:05:48.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's a firefly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.12,0:05:49.17,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You know about those, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.88,0:05:51.42,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,First time seeing one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.42,0:05:53.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I guess those from here come out later than others. {Prime time of fireflies are June. CAS world is currently August.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.68,0:06:00.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.55,0:06:01.72,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.72,0:06:03.76,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Is there something on my face?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.76,0:06:04.85,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.85,0:06:07.60,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then don't stare at other people's faces like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.73,0:06:12.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.48,0:06:14.32,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You have something you want to say, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.61,0:06:18.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What? Are you still scared of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.70,0:06:22.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,All right. Say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.74,0:06:24.66,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I won't yell any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.66,0:06:26.54,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.29,0:06:30.00,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Tell me about Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.50,0:06:34.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ask Sanae-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.13,0:06:36.55,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,She won't tell me even if I ask her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.13,0:06:38.63,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She wants me to tell you, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.63,0:06:44.76,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ask Sanae-san. Tell her that I didn't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.66,0:07:07.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.37,0:07:09.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't fall asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.50,0:07:12.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.13,0:07:14.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Wear your hat properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.00,0:07:17.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We have a lot of walking today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.76,0:07:21.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.68,0:07:22.38,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.23,0:07:40.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.74,0:07:44.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Want to have a better look?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.36,0:07:45.37,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.37,0:07:46.37,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.91,0:07:48.41,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,There, spread your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.87,0:07:54.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Wow, you're light.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.67,0:07:55.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.21,0:08:00.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.13,0:08:03.01,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.64,0:08:12.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't run off too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.60,0:08:16.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I guess it was good to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.19,0:08:17.52,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.33,0:08:34.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.62,0:08:37.00,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.34,0:08:39.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Lost what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.84,0:08:41.80,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.93,0:08:46.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.01,0:08:49.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You didn't go any further, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.93,0:08:50.60,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.93,0:08:55.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Strange. You didn't cover much ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.44,0:08:58.23,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio, let's give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.73,0:09:00.77,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Just buy the same one on the way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.77,0:09:01.44,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.65,0:09:04.03,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I want that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.03,0:09:06.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We can't find it, so there's nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.91,0:09:10.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're so stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.81,0:09:35.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.81,0:09:40.98,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm going to take a walk that way. Don't move from here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.98,0:09:41.69,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.32,0:09:51.24,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.70,0:09:52.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I know this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.55,0:10:11.55,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,You're Okazaki Tomoya-san, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.31,0:10:17.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ah... yes. You know me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.52,0:10:21.06,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,Yes. I know of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.48,0:10:24.19,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,My name is Okazaki Shino.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.98,0:10:25.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Okazaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.94,0:10:30.32,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,I'm your father's, Okazaki Naoyuki's, mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.29,0:10:39.04,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,I received a call from Furukawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.41,0:10:42.50,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,They said you'd come if I waited here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.08,0:10:44.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Was it Sanae-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.88,0:10:47.80,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,You've really grown.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.21,0:10:50.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We've met before?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.89,0:10:54.55,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,Right here, when you were still little.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.56,0:10:59.93,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,It was after your mother, Atsuko-san, passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.90,0:11:06.98,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,Is Naoyuki still atoning for his sin?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.86,0:11:11.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No. He should've been released and be living at home by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.95,0:11:13.95,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,I'm sure you experienced many emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.08,0:11:15.66,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.25,0:11:22.54,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,He was not always that foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.58,0:11:29.46,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,Both Atsuko-san and Naoyuki were still students, so people were opposed to their marriage,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.05,0:11:35.76,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,but Naoyuki quit high school and started living in a small apartment with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.89,0:11:40.02,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,Regardless, it seemed he was having a great life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.43,0:11:44.52,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,To live protecting the one he loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.23,0:11:48.02,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,That's all it took to make him happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.44,0:11:53.57,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,Soon, Atsuko-san was pregnant with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.32,0:11:59.66,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,and you were born, treasured by everyone.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:56.91,0:11:58.16,Signs,Gra,0,0,0,,{\fnEraserDust\fs126\an5\frz25.458\c&HADBBCC&\b1\bord0\blur2\3c&HCDDCE7&\pos(516,771)}Okazaki Ushio
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.91,0:11:58.16,Signs,Gra,0,0,0,,{\fnEraserDust\fs126\an5\frz25.458\c&HADBBCC&\b1\bord6.75\blur2\3c&HCDDCE7&\pos(516,771)}Okazaki Ushio
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.79,0:12:08.92,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,But the happy life didn't last long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.13,0:12:12.38,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,Atsuko-san passed away in an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.43,0:12:20.18,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,To him, it was an event too sad to recover from.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.27,0:12:28.02,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,But he couldn't let himself fall into the depths of despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.07,0:12:34.95,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,Tomoya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.24,0:12:39.20,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,He still had you to care for.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.74,0:12:44.12,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,He said he would raise you to be a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.21,0:12:52.80,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,That day, you walked away from here holding hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.80,0:12:55.22,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,Do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.01,0:13:01.68,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,The days after that were the days he worked the hardest in his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.60,0:13:06.60,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,He was fired from many jobs and went from one place to another.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.19,0:13:10.52,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,Even then, he worked with you in his care.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.94,0:13:16.11,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,He would buy you toys with\Nthe little money he had and give you snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.28,0:13:22.16,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,He sacrificed all his luck and chances for success.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.83,0:13:28.54,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,At times, he might have been strict or violent,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.42,0:13:33.80,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,but it was all to raise you well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.67,0:13:41.89,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,However, for Naoyuki, it was a very hard life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.64,0:13:47.10,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,To relieve the pain from work, he indulged in alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.89,0:13:50.98,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,I heard there were times he was drunk and out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.90,0:13:56.53,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,Even so, he chose to live with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.70,0:14:08.04,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,And, by the time you had grown and could choose your own path, Naoyuki had lost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.21,0:14:13.67,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,Work, faith, luck, friends. Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.71,0:14:19.80,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,I heard you're in a situation similar to his right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.14,0:14:22.64,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,It is a painful situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.47,0:14:28.64,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,But that's why I wanted let you hear this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.98,0:14:33.23,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,I wanted you to know what kind of father Naoyuki was.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.19,0:14:39.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He often bought me snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.99,0:14:43.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Also, going on walks, holding hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.45,0:14:47.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why did I forget all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.54,0:14:53.33,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,Tomoya-san. Do you think Naoyuki was a bad father?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.96,0:14:55.75,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.84,0:14:59.76,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm an even worse man than him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.30,0:15:04.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm standing at the same place Pops stood that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.35,0:15:08.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yet I'm weak...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:10.85,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.48,0:15:15.27,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,So is he.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.98,0:15:18.74,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,He's weak, pathetic, and clumsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.61,0:15:24.99,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,Still, he did his best for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.78,0:15:30.75,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,I want to hold him as my pride and joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.33,0:15:34.33,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,He had many failures as a person,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.25,0:15:38.55,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,but I believe that he was a fine father.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.34,0:15:41.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.72,0:15:44.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.64,0:15:47.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I think so, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.47,0:15:51.39,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.02,0:15:56.90,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,I feel relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.74,0:16:08.45,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,Tomoya-san. He tried too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.74,0:16:12.08,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,It's about time he can rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.04,0:16:17.54,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,Can you tell Naoyuki to come home?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.38,0:16:23.05,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,I will be waiting for him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.60,0:16:31.47,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.93,0:16:34.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Did you find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.19,0:16:37.52,Default,Gra,0,0,0,,That's your child?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.15,0:16:39.57,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes. She's Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.45,0:16:49.41,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You've been searching all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.41,0:16:50.16,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.37,0:16:51.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.50,0:17:01.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.51,0:17:06.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We might not be able to find that robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.63,0:17:07.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We can't do anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.43,0:17:10.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So let's buy another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.93,0:17:11.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.10,0:17:18.31,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,There's only one. {As in it's unique}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.19,0:17:21.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,There were lots of them at the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.40,0:17:26.82,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,It's the one you chose and bought for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.99,0:17:32.54,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,First thing from Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.00,0:17:39.75,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.42,0:17:42.63,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Were you lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.46,0:17:44.09,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.38,0:17:48.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Was it fun to come on a trip with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.80,0:17:49.30,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.89,0:17:52.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.02,0:17:58.44,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio... would it be all right if I stayed with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.44,0:18:04.03,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I've been a bad daddy for many years,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.36,0:18:08.53,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,but I'll do my best for you from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.32,0:18:12.08,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So, would it be all right if I stayed with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.70,0:18:14.33,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.12,0:18:15.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.45,0:18:17.71,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I want you to be with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.33,0:18:20.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.67,0:18:25.92,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,But today, I lost an important thing, so I'm sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.22,0:18:29.01,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.64,0:18:31.64,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.47,0:18:42.36,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Is it all right not to hold it in anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.07,0:18:46.07,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Sanae-san told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.49,0:18:50.95,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Places I can cry are in the bathroom...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.16,0:18:54.53,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,...and in Daddy's arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.70,0:18:58.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.21,0:19:00.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.98,0:19:19.81,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.98,0:19:22.81,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.48,0:19:26.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.54,0:19:41.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey, Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.29,0:19:45.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do you want to hear about Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.38,0:19:47.04,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.50,0:19:49.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,All right. Then come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.72,0:20:00.02,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.73,0:20:06.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Mommy was a crybaby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.19,0:20:11.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Even the first time we met.\NShe wasn't sure of herself and was weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.36,0:20:14.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She stood still at the foot of the hill to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.70,0:20:18.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Guess what she said at the foot of the hill?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.04,0:20:22.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She closed her eyes and said, "Sweet bean bread."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.50,0:20:25.37,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That was Mommy's habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.96,0:20:29.92,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Saying out loud something she wanted to eat to gather her courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.84,0:20:37.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sanae-san was really busy at that time\Nand didn't have the time to make Mommy's bento.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.05,0:20:42.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Maybe she could have if she'd tried,\Nbut Mommy said not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.98,0:20:45.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's what Mommy was like.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.31,0:20:47.27,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.69,0:20:55.45,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ah... then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.36,0:20:57.32,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.78,0:20:58.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Mommy was...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.08,0:21:07.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.38,0:21:09.92,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.97,0:21:15.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.35,0:21:21.47,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Daddy...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.14,0:21:25.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why are you crying, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.98,0:21:31.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sorry. I was remembering Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.32,0:21:39.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,All right, let's keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.62,0:21:44.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Mommy wanted to do theater at that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.12,0:21:46.50,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa. I found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.50,0:21:46.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do you know what theater is?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.21,0:21:49.54,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,I finally found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.09,0:21:53.75,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,Something only I can protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.96,0:21:58.09,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,The precious thing only I can protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.39,0:22:05.06,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,It was...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.85,0:22:09.81,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(1459.999969,840)\bord0.75\3c&H000000&\blur0.5}To be continued
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.60,0:22:07.85,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,...right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:26.25,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I was gazing at the drifting clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:26.25,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}mi{\kf32}tsu{\kf23}me{\kf23}te {\kf19}i{\kf137}ta {\kf29}na{\kf28}ga{\kf21}re{\kf69}ru {\kf60}ku{\kf61}mo {\kf230}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.25,0:22:33.30,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I was feeling the changes in the sky's color.
